ner of a dazzling, intricate 16-bit world. Souldiers is a handcrafted retro epic for the ages.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419160/extras/97ed3db6cd989d5b93e1ea5eee5ce207.poster.avif?t=1720187905\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419160/extras/97ed3db6cd989d5b93e1ea5eee5ce207.webm?t=1720187905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419160/extras/97ed3db6cd989d5b93e1ea5eee5ce207.mp4?t=1720187905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Featuring:</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419160/extras/4f5332f84282e93dba4216368f307498.webp?t=1720187905\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Gripping melee combat: Slash, parry and dodge your way through an ever-evolving roster of enemies, upgrading your skills and equipment to find a combat style that’s perfect for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419160/extras/4f5332f84282e93dba4216368f307498.webp?t=1720187905\" width=24 height=24 /></span> An interconnected world: Discover a sprawling handcrafted landscape filled with treasures, tough-as-nails bosses and secret pathways.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419160/extras/4f5332f84282e93dba4216368f307498.webp?t=1720187905\" width=24 height=24 /></span> 16-bit sensation: Terragaya comes to life with vibrant world-class pixel art packed to the brim with details.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419160/extras/4f5332f84282e93dba4216368f307498.webp?t=1720187905\" width=24 height=24 /></span> Smart moves: Solve environmental puzzles and leap from place to place using an ever-expanding moveset.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419160/extras/9c5dcfb07f82620357074b894c6b3183.poster.avif?t=1720187905\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419160/extras/9c5dcfb07f82620357074b894c6b3183.webm?t=1720187905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419160/extras/9c5dcfb07f82620357074b894c6b3183.mp4?t=1720187905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4GHz (4 Core) CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 | AMD Radeon RX 580</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.2 GHz (4 Core) CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Ti | AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"developers":["Retro Forge"],"publishers":["Dear Villagers"],"release_date":"2 Jun, 2022"}